#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/sgml-common.xml:84
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of SGML Common"
msgstr "Instalação do SGML Common"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/sgml-common.xml:87
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Instead of the normal convention of including the autotools files in the "
"package, the maintainers included symlinks to the files in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/usr/share/automake</filename>. For previous versions of"
" <application>Automake</application> this convention is correct, but recent "
"versions of <application>Automake</application> install the internal files "
"in version specific directories. This causes the "
"<command>configure</command> script to abort. To fix this error, the "
"autotools are regenerated. Since the included "
"<filename>Makefile.am</filename> file uses a syntax not supported by current"
" versions of <application>Automake</application>, a patch is required to fix"
" the syntax."
msgstr ""
"Em vez da convenção normal de incluir os arquivos das autotools no pacote, "
"os(as) mantenedores(as) incluíram links simbólicos para os arquivos em "
"<filename class=\"directory\">/usr/share/automake</filename>. Para versões "
"anteriores do <application>Automake</application> essa convenção está "
"correta, mas versões recentes do <application>Automake</application> "
"instalam os arquivos internos em diretórios específicos da versão. Isso faz "
"com que o conjunto de comandos sequenciais <command>configure</command> "
"aborte. Para corrigir esse erro, as autotools são regeneradas. Como o "
"arquivo <filename>Makefile.am</filename> incluído usa uma sintaxe não "
"suportada pelas versões atuais do <application>Automake</application>, um "
"remendo é exigido para corrigir a sintaxe."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/sgml-common.xml:100
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../sgml-common-0.6.3-manpage-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"autoreconf -f -i</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../sgml-common-0.6.3-manpage-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"autoreconf -f -i</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/sgml-common.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>SGML Common</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>SGML Common</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/sgml-common.xml:108
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr --sysconfdir=/etc &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/sgml-common.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid "This package does not come with a test suite."
msgstr "Esse pacote não vem com uma suíte de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/sgml-common.xml:116
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/sgml/sgml-common.xml:119
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make docdir=/usr/share/doc install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install-catalog --add /etc/sgml/sgml-ent.cat \\\n"
"    /usr/share/sgml/sgml-iso-entities-8879.1986/catalog &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install-catalog --add /etc/sgml/sgml-docbook.cat \\\n"
"    /etc/sgml/sgml-ent.cat</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make docdir=/usr/share/doc install &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install-catalog --add /etc/sgml/sgml-ent.cat \\\n"
"    /usr/share/sgml/sgml-iso-entities-8879.1986/catalog &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"install-catalog --add /etc/sgml/sgml-docbook.cat \\\n"
"    /etc/sgml/sgml-ent.cat</userinput>"

